# auth.md template

This file is **documentation**, not the runtime artifact.

The Identity API generates `/auth.md` from typed capabilities via
`renderAuthMd` in `packages/agent-protocols`. Runtime metadata at:

- `/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource` (RFC 9728)
- `/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server` (RFC 8414 + `agent_auth`)

is authoritative if this document and those URLs disagree.

Compatibility revision: WorkOS auth.md repository `AUTH.md` / CHANGELOG **v0.6.0 (2026-06-10)**.
ID-JAG: `draft-ietf-oauth-identity-assertion-authz-grant-04` (disabled).

See ADR 0092 and `docs/protocol-conformance.md`.
